 "notes": "Composition-specific record for the Fe-free 5K2124 specimen. The stored lattice and coordinates are the official deposited 1.7 GPa, 293(2) K Pbnm refinement. Its idealized occupancies give Na4Al4Si4O16, whereas electron-microprobe analysis gives Na0.93Al1.02Si1.00O4 per nominal formula unit. The refinement therefore supplies a diffraction model for the measured specimen but does not claim crystallographic resolution of the small analytical non-stoichiometry. The EOS reference volume is the separately fitted zero-pressure conventional-cell volume.",
