   "notes": "Standard third-order Birch-Murnaghan pressure-volume EOS in the Eulerian finite-strain convention at room temperature. V0, K0, and K0_prime were all fitted with EosFit7c; none was fixed. Parenthesized coefficient errors are retained as generic published uncertainties because the source gives neither confidence level nor covariance. The observed range is not a phase-stability guarantee. See docs/qin-2023-naalsio4-eos.md."
